# Sourced inside a Hide after stage.tape and _teams.tape by a beat that needs a
# fleet taller than the screen: seven more agents, each named for a scripted
# opening in scenarios/_pool.json (picked by name) and labelled for it, filed
# into the existing teams and a fourth, platform.
Set TypingSpeed 8ms
Type "/new theo in ~/harbor/api"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "/new mika in ~/harbor/api"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "/new zoe in ~/harbor/api"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "/new wren in ~/harbor/web"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "/new kai in ~/harbor/docs"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "/new finn in ~/harbor/api"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "/new ines in ~/harbor/api"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "/task @theo api · key rotation audit"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/task @mika api · billing webhook types"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/task @zoe api · key-expiry flake"
Enter
Sleep 2s
